# Text is checked out with LF everywhere: Git for Windows would otherwise
# convert it to CRLF (core.autocrlf), which ends up in what the build embeds
# (license and .gitignore templates, shaders, test fixtures).
* text=auto eol=lf
packaging/windows/*.bat text eol=crlf
# GitHub Desktop's test fixtures are repositories (objects, index, refs)
# and working files kept byte for byte, as GitHub Desktop's own
# .gitattributes does for app/test/fixtures
crates/corvene-test-support/fixtures/** -text
